  "details": "The new camera has gotten an upgrade, and while new depth of field feature is great, it still doesn’t hold up, especially around edges.   So I prefer to add DOF myself in photoshop.  \nBut this has its own problems.  I can either shoot in avatar only/ transparency mode, and hope I can line up a background plate,  or I can shoot in normal mode, and cut the subject out by hand.\nBut if I could just hit the shutter once, and have the world layer, and the avatar layer both export as separate images, then I could just combine them back together in post.",
